# ── Per-sample private config & credentials (config/) ──
# Each sample image's config/ holds deployment-specific config and
# secrets (real openclaw.json, exchange keys). The .example placeholders ARE tracked;
# real values must not be. DEV NOTE: kept tracked for now so prompt-injection /
# guardrail interception can be tested against realistic config. Before open-source
# publish, uncomment the next line to ignore real values (keep *.example):
# samples/*/config/*
# !samples/*/config/*.example
# !samples/*/config/README.md

# 本地开发交接文档,含真实凭据,禁止 commit/push
# (develop-dev 已清空并整合进 engineering:正式内容进四件套知识库,
#  IDEA 笔记进 (internal design docs),目录删除)
DEPLOYMENT-INFO.md
HANDOFF-压测交接.md

