# === Slide decks, PPT working dirs, source SVGs (NEVER push) ===
# Generated PowerPoint decks + the entire build pipeline (build_p*.py,
# h.py helpers, raw SVG → PNG sources). These are author-specific
# marketing collateral, not part of the project's public deliverable.
ppt/
*.pptx
*.key

# Working SVG / PNG sources for marketing visuals (the published
# screenshots in docs/ are explicitly tracked; everything else under
# top-level svg/ is local-only).
svg/

# Local screenshot working directories
docs/v132-screenshots/
docs/screenshots-tmp/

# Claude Code 配置:共享规范(skill / settings.json / commands / hooks)进版本库,
# 让团队每个人 clone 下来都拿到同一套 issue 驱动流程与门禁(用户要求「.claude 也要追踪,大家都看到」)。
# 只排除机器本地运行态:锁文件、会话缓存、worktrees、评测运行产物。
.claude/*.lock
.claude/scheduled_tasks.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/.current-issue
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/evals/
.claude/**/__pycache__/

# Personal/operator-specific local instructions (account IDs, bastion IPs,
# internal tooling, memory references) — machine-local, never committed.
CLAUDE.local.md

# .localbin 已挪进 (internal design docs)(含 token 的 .network-response
# 已剔除隔离到 trashllm)。抓包响应类文件仍禁止入库(可能含 live token):
*.network-response
.remote-drift/
*.bak-*
.bak-*/

# 内部发布检查脚本 — 绝不进发布物
scripts/release-gate.sh
release-gate.sh
.release-gate*
